# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both of these are cx_Freeze output (~41 MB each, identical EXE) and are
# regenerated by: python SB2027/dev/build_installer.py build_exe
# Ship the EXE as a GitHub Release asset, not as a committed binary.
SB2027/installer/dist/
SB2027/installer_dist/
build/
dist/

# ── Upstream source repos (vendored, not submoduled) ─────────────────────────
# These three directories are separate git repositories. The files the pack
# actually needs are already vendored into
# SB2027/scripts/SoulburnScripts/lib/ (cinecam.py, tyfx.py, raceanim.py,
# atlas/, maze/), so the upstream checkouts are not part of the deliverable.
# They are ignored rather than deleted - their own .git history stays intact
# on disk.
/cinematic_cameras/
/tyflow_scripts/
/max_mcp_server/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# ── 3ds Max scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.mxsbak
maxscrpt.dsk
